libcaes
------------------------------------------
libcaes is a library to support cross-platform AES encryption.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcaes-devel-20261028-1bl1
  libcaes1-20261028-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libcaes

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libcaes/archive/refs/tags/20261028.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libcaes-20261028-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libcaes-20261028-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libcaes-20261028-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcaes-20261028-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcaes1-20261028-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcaes-devel-20261028-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libcaes-20261028-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libcaes)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libcaes.README
  /usr/share/doc/libcaes/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libcaes/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libcaes/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libcaes/README

(libcaes1)
  /usr/bin/cygcaes-1.dll

(libcaes-devel)
  /usr/include/libcaes.h
  /usr/include/libcaes/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libcaes/error.h
  /usr/include/libcaes/extern.h
  /usr/include/libcaes/features.h
  /usr/include/libcaes/types.h
  /usr/lib/libcaes.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libcaes.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libcaes.3.gz

(python312-libcaes)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pycaes.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

